    {
      "id": 49287,
      "name": "Katsue",
      "username": "Katsue",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-12T23:02:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Broccoli is correct. Discard, draw, and play all force a shuffle. Reveal does not.&nbsp;Hope this helps!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I had no idea. This desperately needs to be in the Shattered Timelines rulebook (or in online versions of the existing rulebooks).</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:22:41.108Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
