      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"Christopher\"]\n\nBroccoli is correct. Discard, draw, and play all force a shuffle. Reveal does not.&nbsp;Hope this helps!\n\n[/quote]\n\nI had no idea. This desperately needs to be in the Shattered Timelines rulebook (or in online versions of the existing rulebooks).\n",
